yum/dnf
To install
----------
sudo su -
dnf install git
sudo dnf install nginx -yum
To Remove/delete
----------------
dnf remove git -y
sudo dnf remove nginx -y

path: cd /etc/yum.repo.d

To see already installed 
------------------------
dnf list installed (available we can install)
dnf list installed | grep python

private key stored by default (/.ssh/id_rsa)

Service management
------------------
systemctl start nginx
systemctl stop nginx
systemctl status nginx
systemctl enable nginx
systemctl restart nginx

URL: http://<ip>:80